---
export const prerender = true

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Refund & Cancellation Policy — Dexic"
  description="Our policy on order cancellations, in-app purchases, and refunds across the Dexic website and our products, including Woofy, Starly, and Blood Finder."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span>Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="h-hero hero-title">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        Our policy on order cancellations, in-app purchases, and refunds across the Dexic website and our products,
        including Woofy, Starly, and Blood Finder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          This Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy applies to purchases and orders made through the Dexic website
          (dexic.tech) and through our mobile applications, including <strong>Woofy</strong>, <strong>Starly</strong>,
          <strong>Blood Finder</strong>, and any future products we release. By placing an order or making a
          purchase through our website or apps, you agree to this policy.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Order Cancellations</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            You may cancel an order placed through our website at any time before it has been processed or
            fulfilled, by contacting us at <a href="mailto:contact@dexic.tech">contact@dexic.tech</a> or
            +92 305 8688 545.
          </li>
          <li>
            Once an order has been processed, shipped, or a digital service has been delivered or consumed (for
            example, once a live session on Starly has started, or a request on Woofy or Blood Finder has been acted
            upon), it can no longer be cancelled.
          </li>
          <li>
            We reserve the right to cancel any order at our discretion — for example, if goods or services are no
            longer available, we are unable to deliver to your location, or we suspect fraudulent activity. In such
            cases, you will be notified and any payment already made will be refunded in full.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. In-App Purchases and Subscriptions</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Purchases made through <strong>Google Play</strong> or the <strong>Apple App Store</strong> within Woofy,
            Starly, Blood Finder, or any other Dexic app (such as premium features, coins, or session bookings) are
            billed and processed directly by Google or Apple, and are subject to their respective refund and
            cancellation policies.
          </li>
          <li>
            To request a refund for an in-app purchase, please use the refund process provided by
            <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Play</a>
            or the
            <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT204084" target="_blank" rel="noopener">App Store</a>, or
            contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@dexic.tech">contact@dexic.tech</a> and we will assist you in
            escalating the request where possible.
          </li>
          <li>
            Subscriptions can be cancelled at any time through your Google Play or App Store account settings.
            Cancelling a subscription stops future billing but does not automatically refund the current billing
            period.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Refund Eligibility</h2>
        <p>Refunds may be issued where:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>you were charged in error or were double-charged;</li>
          <li>the product or service you paid for was not delivered or provided;</li>
          <li>a service booked through our apps (such as a Starly live session) was cancelled by us or by the artist before it took place; or</li>
          <li>you are otherwise entitled to a refund under applicable consumer protection law.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Refunds are generally not available for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>digital content or services that have already been delivered, accessed, or consumed;</li>
          <li>live sessions or bookings that have already taken place; or</li>
          <li>a change of mind after a service has been rendered.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Refund Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Approved refunds will be processed to your original method of payment within <strong>7–14 business
          days</strong>, depending on your bank or payment provider. Refunds for purchases made through Google Play
          or the App Store are processed by Google or Apple according to their own timelines.
        </p>

        <h2>6. How to Request a Refund or Cancellation</h2>
        <p>To request a refund or cancel an order, please contact us with your order or transaction details:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@dexic.tech">contact@dexic.tech</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +92 305 8688 545</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> Islamabad, Pakistan</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We aim to respond to all refund and cancellation requests within 2–3 business days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 32px 80px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 52px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 24px 60px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }
</style>
